      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "歡迎光臨！\n這裡是有趣的客人<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n常來光顧的咖啡館，「龍捲風」。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
