      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "歡迎光臨！\n這裡是時尚愛好者的聚集地，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n咖啡館「時髦」。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
