      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "歡迎光臨！\n這裡是時髦滿點的<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n咖啡館，「旭日」。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
